MODEL DivisibilityTheorem

ENV NumberTheory

INSTANCE k IN NumberTheory
INSTANCE k_squared IN NumberTheory
INSTANCE n1 IN NumberTheory
INSTANCE n2 IN NumberTheory
INSTANCE n3 IN NumberTheory
INSTANCE n4 IN NumberTheory
INSTANCE n5 IN NumberTheory
INSTANCE n6 IN NumberTheory

PROPERTY k value = 12
PROPERTY k_squared value = 144
PROPERTY k_squared derived_from = k

PROPERTY n1 value = 1
PROPERTY n2 value = 2
PROPERTY n3 value = 3
PROPERTY n4 value = 4
PROPERTY n5 value = 6
PROPERTY n6 value = 12

CALCULATE n1 divides_k = n1 EQUIV 0 MOD k
# Should be true
CALCULATE n2 divides_k = n2 EQUIV 0 MOD k
CALCULATE n3 divides_k = n3 EQUIV 0 MOD k
CALCULATE n4 divides_k = n4 EQUIV 0 MOD k
CALCULATE n5 divides_k = n5 EQUIV 0 MOD k
CALCULATE n6 divides_k = n6 EQUIV 0 MOD k

CALCULATE n1 divides_k_squared = n1 EQUIV 0 MOD k_squared
CALCULATE n2 divides_k_squared = n2 EQUIV 0 MOD k_squared
CALCULATE n3 divides_k_squared = n3 EQUIV 0 MOD k_squared
CALCULATE n4 divides_k_squared = n4 EQUIV 0 MOD k_squared
CALCULATE n5 divides_k_squared = n5 EQUIV 0 MOD k_squared
CALCULATE n6 divides_k_squared = n6 EQUIV 0 MOD k_squared

DOMAIN DivisorsOfK IN NumberTheory
DOMAIN DivisorsOfKSquared IN NumberTheory
DOMAIN Integers IN NumberTheory

RELATE k Integers IN NumberTheory
RELATE k_squared Integers IN NumberTheory
RELATE n1 Integers IN NumberTheory
RELATE n2 Integers IN NumberTheory
RELATE n3 Integers IN NumberTheory
RELATE n4 Integers IN NumberTheory
RELATE n5 Integers IN NumberTheory
RELATE n6 Integers IN NumberTheory

RELATE n1 DivisorsOfK IN NumberTheory
RELATE n2 DivisorsOfK IN NumberTheory
RELATE n3 DivisorsOfK IN NumberTheory
RELATE n4 DivisorsOfK IN NumberTheory
RELATE n5 DivisorsOfK IN NumberTheory
RELATE n6 DivisorsOfK IN NumberTheory

RELATE n1 DivisorsOfKSquared IN NumberTheory
RELATE n2 DivisorsOfKSquared IN NumberTheory
RELATE n3 DivisorsOfKSquared IN NumberTheory
RELATE n4 DivisorsOfKSquared IN NumberTheory
RELATE n5 DivisorsOfKSquared IN NumberTheory
RELATE n6 DivisorsOfKSquared IN NumberTheory

RULE DivisorOfK IF n1 IN Domain DivisorsOfK THEN divides_original AXIOM true
RULE DivisorInheritance IF n1 IN Domain DivisorsOfK THEN also_in_k_squared AXIOM true
RULE SquarePreservesDivisibility IF k_squared IN Domain Integers THEN preserves_divisors AXIOM true

QUERY AllDivisorsOfK n1 IN Domain DivisorsOfK
QUERY AllDivisorsOfKSquared n1 IN Domain DivisorsOfKSquared

PROVE SubsetRelation: DivisorsOfK SUBSET_OF DivisorsOfKSquared
PROVE ElementMembership: n3 IN DivisorsOfK IMPLIES n3 IN DivisorsOfKSquared
PROVE DivisibilityTransitive: n2 DIVIDES k AND k_squared EQUALS k_TIMES_k IMPLIES n2 DIVIDES k_squared
ASSERT ConsistentDivisibility: ALL_DIVISORS_OF_K_ARE_IN_K_SQUARED
ASSERT MathematicallySound: NO_CONTRADICTIONS IN DIVISIBILITY_RULES

